title: "Kiruk — Spec-driven Creative OS"
abstract: >
  Kiruk is an open-source creative studio operating system: a monorepo holding
  vision, brand, design tokens, ISM lab experiments, in-house digital products,
  client universes, and an end-to-end spec-driven workflow from scribble to ship.
